From b0d2c52b5de7bb84869db68be4589bd8ddf8f898 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaeliGlow <caeliglow@mockifylab.local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:13:03 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] caeliglow: add [caeliglow] config section with motion
 settings and elastic easing

New [caeliglow] table: motion (classic/soft/fizzy/morphy), duration_ms,
elasticity, hover_open. Adds the EaseOutElastic easing curve used by the
fizzy/morphy springs and gates bar hover-reveal on hover_open.
